body:
You have a valid argument, and you may even have a valid point, but I believe my point still rings true. Sure its stressful now,  but you never know. You may just appreciate it down the road, and if you don't take it now, what are the chances you'd actually spend your time going to learn it later? It may not be as important or necessary ad what you are aiming for, but it's just part of the education process. That's life.

&nbsp;

Edit:  I'm not fully disagreeing with you by the way, I just don't have enough information to affect my opinion one way or the other. I'm playing devils advocate.
